; Layer 4, the core: what the machines call paradise. Ancient machinery, older than the foundry, dark bronze and black
; iron in a crimson haze; the accent is ember red, the glow of the heart they descend toward (docs/art-direction.md: the
; palette warms with depth, to dark amber and ember at the core).

